msgstr "⟪k:0⟫因为连孩子自己也没发现。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D963F74B_3365_4AEA_9DF9_E5223184BAEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
