msgstr "⟪k:0⟫应该有享受到一段短暂的幸福时光吧……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A031404_A212_485A_951E_7A1AA5D74456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ed719ada3309aa12e2dc3b79f939b6a6f1e86a5a3e5c152d5a44773de5fc7df
