msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, she still doesn’t ⟪k:1⟫know⟪k:2⟫ the child she gave birth to..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那时的她并不知晓，⟪k:1⟫她为人世间诞下的是一个诅咒，⟪k:2⟫足以让天使化作恶魔、⟪k:3⟫让人类成为魔"
"女……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E2145377_DA66_4D2D_BD1F_344ABAC574D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74df8732e33d9fde88aac582a8f0d3a9f73bf5de1d898bd5d068ff65b33232b2
