"⟪k:0⟫Gorgeous, aren’t they?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Such a deep, enchanting color... ⟪k:3⟫like two little jewels."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫多漂亮的眼眸啊。⟪k:1⟫深邃澄澈得仿佛要将人吸进去……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫简直就像——迷人的宝石一样。"

